invariant: INV-36
file: build.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: build.zig's tcp-blocking export list names ch_handshake, the blocking
  driver's internal entry, so the localizer keeps it global and a Zig object
  exports a name make's does not. Two such objects in one image, or one beside
  an application that defines the name, would not link.

--- old
const public_tcp_blocking = [_][]const u8{ "ch_connect", "ch_read", "ch_write", "ch_writable_len", "ch_close" } ++ public_ticket;
--- new
const public_tcp_blocking = [_][]const u8{ "ch_connect", "ch_read", "ch_write", "ch_writable_len", "ch_close", "ch_handshake" } ++ public_ticket;
